# Cloudflare Pages headers.
#
# IMPORTANT, verified against the live site on 2026-08-17: Pages applies the
# security headers below, but it IGNORES Cache-Control from this file entirely
# and serves its own (public, max-age=14400) for every static asset. Both an
# extension glob (/*.css) and an exact path (/robots.txt) were tried and neither
# changed the served Cache-Control. Do not add cache directives here expecting
# them to work.

/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Permissions-Policy: geolocation=(), microphone=(), camera=(), interest-cohort=()

# Content-Type is not yet confirmed to apply on Pages the way security headers
# do (only Cache-Control was tested and found ignored). Verify after deploy:
# curl -sI https://midmeeting.com/bridge.sh should show text/plain.
/skills/*
  Content-Type: text/plain; charset=utf-8

/bridge.sh
  Content-Type: text/plain; charset=utf-8
